The **Odisea** platform is designed as an exact, high-performance replica and Windows 11 extension of [Ulysses](https://ulysses.app) for macOS. It strictly honors the _What You See Is What You Mean_ (WYSIWYM) writing paradigm while introducing deep desktop integration.

