Tabular data is structured cleanly using either native `(tbl)` sheets or standard grid syntax:

| Component ID | Module Name | Technology Stack | Latency SLA |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `MOD-01` | **Lexer / AST** | Rust + EBNF Parser | < 0.5 ms |
| `MOD-02` | **Layout Engine** | DirectWrite / Direct2D | < 16.6 ms (60 fps) |
| `MOD-03` | **Style Compiler** | ULSS Evaluator | < 2.0 ms |
| `MOD-04` | **Storage Layer** | SQLite WAL mode | < 1.0 ms |

